  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Use OIDC when auth is missing by @malclocke in https://github.com/buildkite/test-engine-client/pull/507\n* Te 5851 add linter rule for initialisms by @malclocke in https://github.com/buildkite/test-engine-client/pull/511\n* chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/mod from 0.35.0 to 0.36.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/buildkite/test-engine-client/pull/505\n* Bind BUILDKITE_PARALLEL_JOB_COUNT in `bktec plan` (TE-5745) by @niceking in https://github.com/buildkite/test-engine-client/pull/501\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/urfave/cli/v3 from 3.8.0 to 3.9.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/buildkite/test-engine-client/pull/513\n* chore(deps): bump ruby from 4.0.3-slim-bookworm to 4.0.4-slim-bookworm in /.buildkite by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/buildkite/test-engine-client/pull/512\n* chore(deps): bump python from 3.15.0a8-bookworm to 3.15.0b1-bookworm in /.buildkite by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/buildkite/test-engine-client/pull/503\n* Update changelog for 2.6.0 by @malclocke in https://github.com/buildkite/test-engine-client/pull/514\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/buildkite/test-engine-client/compare/v2.5.1...v2.6.0\n\n",
